{"title":"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_14\">Problem 14</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 14\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/3/3d3d228861a5f825113078aab2e88d32a04b2094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$whatsis$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f116240ac463e1ec74d9f736889d26b6103ea67f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$so$\" width=\"17\" height=\"8\" /> when the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/4/1c4e88fd65033531d4e0bcaf121dbb474a25d8cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$whosis$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/e/a5e5a23395e6d60a8dbdf3590931bdc0bde00873.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$is$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f116240ac463e1ec74d9f736889d26b6103ea67f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$so$\" width=\"17\" height=\"8\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f116240ac463e1ec74d9f736889d26b6103ea67f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$so$\" width=\"17\" height=\"8\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/2/fd278bcdf7c367f944103e3e8ee1d7e93d64cba5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$is \\cdot so$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" />, \nwhat is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/b/d1be297744670fb2907e085cf3fabc2fa540709a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$whosis \\cdot whatsis$\" width=\"132\" height=\"12\" /> when the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/4/1c4e88fd65033531d4e0bcaf121dbb474a25d8cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$whosis$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f116240ac463e1ec74d9f736889d26b6103ea67f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$so$\" width=\"17\" height=\"8\" />, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f116240ac463e1ec74d9f736889d26b6103ea67f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$so$\" width=\"17\" height=\"8\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f116240ac463e1ec74d9f736889d26b6103ea67f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$so$\" width=\"17\" height=\"8\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/d/ffd023e32a46b607ded079097d9cf168972ab3ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$so \\cdot so$\" width=\"48\" height=\"8\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/e/a5e5a23395e6d60a8dbdf3590931bdc0bde00873.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$is$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is two \n(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/9/48951ee8880354c9b3c3d3d3cfa1d0213b712063.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$whatsis, whosis, is$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"150\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f116240ac463e1ec74d9f736889d26b6103ea67f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$so$\" width=\"17\" height=\"8\" /> are variables taking positive values)? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/f/a1fecd4cab57f5221b8e5f65d8a99386d1e079fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ whosis \\cdot is \\cdot so \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ whosis \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ is \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ so\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ so\\text{ and }so$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"581\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the problem, we are given:\n</p>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/2/be2e2c9c018fc00bbbd15c084419387da03205cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$whatsis = so$\" width=\"105\" height=\"12\" /> </center>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/e/9fe87567abba61c54d4ab3fcc9ffd413b7288185.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$whosis = is$\" width=\"95\" height=\"12\" /> </center>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/f/51f1fca5774f59ff5e9367840c1dc15f2061f437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$so + so = is \\cdot so$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"126\" height=\"14\" /> </center>\n<p>We want to find what <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/b/00b8d43a34b390b2307489bad89fcfff664a7512.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$whatsis \\cdot whosis$\" width=\"132\" height=\"12\" /> is when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/a/9eacd815d8539cf7e38950a61bde663d471c4c63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$whosis = so$\" width=\"98\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/3/e134a1e4ba99088068ffe41cbc6177cafe574fe7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$so + so = so \\cdot so$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"129\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/4/6e497a6068642222c6fd9aebe3b92c48d98850b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$is = 2$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/4/6e497a6068642222c6fd9aebe3b92c48d98850b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$is = 2$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b157c786480a8bb0792abbe25a747e31c960236.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$so + so = is \\cdot so = so \\cdot so$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"198\" height=\"14\" /> (from the given), that means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fb732aa9ce1e5c1e17ff757be3c14fc08fcec99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$so = 2$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />. Now we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eacbe17571604e4c633cd847e7d0a75263ff3ca8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$whatsis = 2$\" width=\"96\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/b/8abe3b4a95d960eadb2e794686d080f2a8f3d97c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$whosis = 2$\" width=\"89\" height=\"12\" /> as well because they are equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f116240ac463e1ec74d9f736889d26b6103ea67f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$so$\" width=\"17\" height=\"8\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/e/a5e5a23395e6d60a8dbdf3590931bdc0bde00873.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$is$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, respectively.\n</p><p>Plugging in the values, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/7/4c7161f512c6bc09c79d9d795068ff419e3f2073.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$whatsis \\cdot whosis = so \\cdot is = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"235\" height=\"13\" />. This also means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/5/7554394b5844d0e089ab8726a48e03c6a9d6a230.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$whatsis \\cdot whosis = so + so$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"214\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Taking a look at the answer choices, we see that our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a4834d2fee306756a984a989f97c61fbf50bb424.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ so\\text{ and }so}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"119\" height=\"30\" />. ~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Jiang147369\">jiang147369</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSME\">1975 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1975 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1975\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"